{nav:{home:"Home",about:"About",jobs:"Scam Types",advantages:"Why Us",faq:"FAQs",howToStart:"Our Process",testimonials:"Case Results",applyNow:"Free Consultation"},hero:{badge:"Anti-Fraud Law Firm · Cross-Border Recovery",title:"Recover funds lost to online fraud",titleLine1:"Scammed online?",titleLine2:"We help you recover.",subtitle:"We combine legal action, fund-flow analysis, and multi-jurisdiction cooperation to help victims of online scams trace, freeze, and recover stolen assets.",cta:"Get Free Consultation",ctaSecondary:"Common Cases",partTime:"Rapid Response",partTimeDesc:"The first 72 hours are the golden window for fund tracing and recovery.",fullTime:"End-to-End Handling",fullTimeDesc:"From initial case review to legal action and ongoing coordination.",decor:{flexible:"Confidential Handling",location:"Cross-Border Coordination",savings:"Result-Oriented Strategy",earnings:"Licensed Legal Team"},features:{response:{title:"72-Hour Response",desc:"The golden window for fund tracing and freezing"},tracing:{title:"Fund-Flow Tracing",desc:"On-chain and off-chain transaction analysis"},legal:{title:"Licensed Legal Team",desc:"Anti-fraud lawyers with real courtroom experience"},network:{title:"Cross-Border Network",desc:"Banking and legal partners across jurisdictions"},confidential:{title:"Strictly Confidential",desc:"Privileged handling of every case detail"}},stats:{cases:"4,000+ cases",experience:"Anti-fraud experience"}},about:{badge:"About the Firm",title:"It's not just fund recovery — it's helping you regain control.",description:"We are an anti-fraud law firm focused on the recovery of funds lost through online investment scams, telecom fraud, phishing, and crypto-related deception. Through fund-flow analysis, legal path design, and cross-jurisdiction cooperation, we help victims quickly lock down key accounts and responsible parties — pursuing recovery beyond what police reports alone can achieve.",description2:"Our team combines licensed lawyers, financial investigators, and cross-border cooperation partners. Every case is evaluated confidentially, and clients receive a clear action plan, realistic expectations, and continuous updates throughout the process.",globalReach:"Multi-Region Coordination",globalReachDesc:"We operate through a network of legal partners across Asia, Europe, and North America to trace funds that move across borders.",cta:"Submit Case Details",titleAlt:"Not just chasing funds — we help you take back control.",descAlt:"In most fraud cases, time is the deciding factor. Once funds are moved across multiple layers or across borders, individuals almost never complete the recovery on their own. We combine fund-flow analysis, legal path design, and multi-region cooperation to quickly lock down key accounts and responsible parties — giving you more room to recover beyond a police report.",descAlt2:"Our service covers virtual asset scams, bank transfer fraud, and all types of online deception — with staged analysis, ongoing follow-up, and coordinated legal action.",fact1Label:"Case experience",fact1Value:"4,000+ cases analyzed",fact1Desc:"Extensive experience across investment, telecom, and crypto fraud scenarios.",fact2Label:"Coordination network",fact2Value:"600+ tracing resources",fact2Desc:"Cross-border banking, exchange, and legal partners for fund tracing.",fact3Label:"Golden window",fact3Value:"72-hour rapid response",fact3Desc:"The first 72 hours are critical — we mobilize immediately after intake."},ctaConnect:{badge:"Let's Talk",title:"Confidential legal support for {{country}} fraud victims",description:"We handle inquiries from victims located in {{country}} and coordinate with international partners for cross-border cases.",cta:"Request Free Case Review"},jobs:{title:"Common types of online fraud we handle",titleLine1:"Common",titleLine2:"online fraud types",titleLine3:"we help you fight.",cta:"See all fraud types",subtitle:"Understanding common tactics helps you assess your situation and take the right next step. Each scenario below outlines how our team approaches recovery.",applyNow:"Discuss My Case",viewMore:"View More Scam Types",perHour:"Complexity",perDay:"Cases handled",perMonth:"/month",positions:{dataAnnotation:{title:"Cryptocurrency Scams",description:"Fake exchanges, rug-pulls, and wallet-drain schemes. We trace on-chain transactions, identify off-ramps, and coordinate with exchanges and law enforcement to freeze funds.",tag1:"High Risk",tag2:"On-Chain Tracing",tag3:"Cross-Border"},dataCollection:{title:"Online Investment Scams",description:"Fake trading platforms with manipulated dashboards and blocked withdrawals. We investigate the platform, map fund routes, and build a legal case for recovery.",tag1:"Platform Investigation",tag2:"Fund Path Analysis",tag3:"Evidence Package"},survey:{title:"Bank Transfer Scams",description:"Impersonation and authorized-push-payment scams that trick victims into wiring funds to fraudster-controlled accounts. We coordinate with banks to trace and freeze accounts as fast as possible.",tag1:"Bank Coordination",tag2:"Account Tracing",tag3:"Urgent Response"},dataEntry:{title:"Romance & Dating Scams",description:"Long-term social engineering through dating apps and social media that ends in fake investments or emergency wire requests. We map the underlying network and pursue funds across jurisdictions.",tag1:"Social Engineering",tag2:"Network Mapping",tag3:"Fund Recovery"},content:{title:"Credit Card Fraud",description:"Unauthorized charges, card-not-present fraud, and stolen card details used across merchants. We support chargeback strategy, evidence collection, and legal action against operators.",tag1:"Chargeback Support",tag2:"Evidence Collection",tag3:"Issuer Coordination"},onlineCustomer:{title:"Part-Time Job & Recruitment Scams",description:'Fake part-time gigs and recruitment offers requiring "deposits", "training fees", or task-based "unlocks". We analyze the operator, gather cross-user evidence, and pursue legal recovery paths.',tag1:"Group Cases",tag2:"Operator Tracing",tag3:"Class Coordination",type:"Common"},other:{title:"Other Online Fraud",description:"From gambling site withholdings to NFT drainers — if funds moved through digital channels, we can assess whether recovery is feasible.",tag1:"Case Review",tag2:"Custom Strategy",tag3:"Feasibility Report",type:"Assessed"}},review1:'"Recovered a significant portion within weeks — the team stayed on top of the case day and night."',review2:'"They found routes the police could not access and coordinated directly with the exchange."',review3:'"Clear expectations from day one — no false promises, just a real plan."',review4:'"The banking coordination was fast. Two of the receiving accounts were frozen in time."',review5:'"I finally understood what happened to my money and what could still be done about it."',review6:'"Professional, discreet, and genuinely focused on results rather than fees."'},advantages:{badge:"Why Choose Us",title:"A legal team built for real recovery, not just consultation.",titleLine1:"Built for",titleLine2:"real recovery",titleLine3:", not just consultation.",learnMore:"Learn more",subtitle:"Fraud recovery requires speed, evidence, and cross-border coordination — three things individuals rarely have access to alone.",items:{flexibility:{title:"Proactive Intervention",description:"We don't just wait for police reports — we begin fund tracing and legal action within hours of intake."},support:{title:"Result-Oriented Strategy",description:"Every case gets a realistic recovery plan with defined milestones, not open-ended legal fees."},earnings:{title:"Cross-Border Cooperation",description:"A network of banks, exchanges, and legal partners across multiple jurisdictions."},guidance:{title:"Confidential Case Handling",description:"All communications are protected. Only the team assigned to your case sees the details."}}},howToStart:{badge:"Our Process",title:"Recovering Funds Just 4 Key Steps",subtitle:"A structured, transparent process so you know exactly what happens at every stage of your case.",steps:{step1:{title:"Initial Consultation",description:"Gather case background and fund transfer details to assess the situation and possible direction."},step2:{title:"Fund Path Analysis",description:"Reconstruct the flow of funds across accounts, platforms, and jurisdictions to identify key nodes."},step3:{title:"Evidence & Strategy",description:"Package the evidence and design the legal response tailored to your case type."},step4:{title:"Ongoing Legal Support",description:"Push the case forward with coordinated banking, legal, and cross-border action until resolution."}},cta:"Start Free Consultation"},team:{badge:"Our Legal Team",title:"Our Legal Team",subtitle:"Your case is assigned to the person who has handled that type before. Here's who you may be working with.",members:{member1:{title:"Nicole Friedlander",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-859-787-4156",description:"People come to us after they have already been told nothing can be done. In about half those cases, something can."},member2:{title:"John J. Liolos",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-603-365-1278",description:"Most of my files touch three or four jurisdictions at once. The hard part is figuring out which country process will actually get you somewhere."},member3:{title:"Steven R. Peikin",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-440-258-6622",description:"Speed matters. The first 48 hours after a transfer often decide whether the money can be frozen or gone."},member4:{title:"Melike Tokatlioglu",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-270-392-5015",description:"With digital assets, it comes down to three questions: where the money went, who controls that wallet, and what a court will accept as proof."}}},testimonials:{badge:"Case Results",title:"User Feedback",subtitle:"Selected outcomes from cases we have handled. Client names are anonymized to protect privacy.",cta:"Get Free Consultation",review1:'"After being caught in a phishing scam, I contacted the firm. Fund tracing started within 48 hours and we eventually recovered a large portion of the loss."',review1Name:"Smith",review1Role:"The main funds have been successfully recovered",review2:`"I lost money on a fake crypto trading platform. The team mapped the on-chain flow, worked with the exchange, and secured a settlement I didn't think was possible."`,review2Name:"Jones",review2Role:"Most of the money has been successfully recovered",review3:'"A telecom scam drained two of my bank accounts. The lawyers coordinated with the banks quickly and one of the receiving accounts was frozen in time."',review3Name:"Kaylee",review3Role:"Some important funds have been recovered"},cta2:{badge:"Contact the Firm",title1:"Confidential legal support",title2:"when every hour counts",description:"Submit your case details for a free, no-obligation review. All information is treated as privileged and confidential.",feature1:"Free initial case assessment",feature2:"Response within 2 business hours",feature3:"Licensed anti-fraud legal team",feature4:"Cross-border coordination available",whyChooseUs:"Why clients choose us",antiFraudLegalSupport:"Anti-fraud legal support",agreeContact:"I agree that our team can contact me regarding my application via WhatsApp or email.",formBadge:"Confidential intake",formTitle:"Request Case Review",applyNow:"Submit for Free Consultation"},footer:{brand:"Sullivan & Cromwell LLP · Anti-Fraud Law Firm",tagline:"Anti-fraud legal team focused on the recovery of funds lost to online scams.",description:"Sullivan & Cromwell LLP is an international law firm working on cross-border fraud and public safety.",antiFraudLawFirm:"International law firm","247CaseIntake":"24/7 Case Intake",quickLinks:"Quick Links",contact:"Contact",email:"contact@Sullivan & Cromwell LLP.com",emailUs:"Email us",callUs:"Call us",visitUs:"Visit us",copyright:"Copyright © 2026 Sullivan & Cromwell LLP. All rights reserved.",rights:"All rights reserved",backToTop:"Back to top",privacy:"Privacy Policy",terms:"Terms of Service",currentCountry:"{{country}}"},privacy:{title:"Privacy Policy",sub:"Web Site Terms and Conditions of Use",backHome:"Back to Home",data1:"1. Privacy Policy Blueprint Before or at the time of collecting personal information, we will identify the purposes for which the information is being collected. We will gather and utilize personal data solely for fulfilling those purposes specified by us and for other compatible purposes unless we obtain the consent of the individual concerned or as required by law. We will only retain personal data as long as necessary for the fulfillment of those purposes. We will collect personal information by lawful and fair means and, where appropriate, with the knowledge or consent of the individual concerned. We will protect personal data by security safeguards against loss or theft, as well as unauthorized access, disclosure, copying, use, or modification. Personal information should be relevant to the purposes for which it is to be used, and to the extent necessary for those purposes, should be accurate, complete, and up-to-date.",data2:"2. Terms By accessing this website, you agree to be bound by these website Terms and Conditions of Use, applicable laws, and regulations, and their compliance. If you disagree with any of these terms and conditions, you are prohibited from using or accessing this site. The materials contained in this site are protected by relevant copyright and trademark law.",data3:{title:"3. Use License Permission is granted to temporarily download one copy of the materials (information or software) on the Sullivan & Cromwell LLP site for personal, non-commercial use only. This is a license grant, not a transfer of title, and under this license, you may not:",sub1:"Modify or copy the materials;",sub2:"Use the materials for any commercial purpose or for any public display (commercial or non-commercial);",sub3:"Attempt to decompile or reverse engineer any software contained on the Sullivan & Cromwell LLP site;",sub4:"Remove any copyright or other proprietary notations from the materials;",sub5:'Transfer the materials to another person or "mirror" the materials on any other server. This license shall automatically terminate if you violate any of these restrictions and may be terminated by Sullivan & Cromwell LLP at any time.'},data4:'4. Disclaimer The materials on the Sullivan & Cromwell LLP site are provided "as is". Sullivan & Cromwell LLP makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties, including without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property or other violation of rights. Nothing on this site constitutes legal advice; outcomes vary by case and jurisdiction.',data5:"5. Limitations In no event shall Sullivan & Cromwell LLP or its suppliers be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the materials on the Sullivan & Cromwell LLP website.",data6:"6. Amendments and Errata The materials appearing on the Sullivan & Cromwell LLP website could include technical, typographical, or photographic errors. Sullivan & Cromwell LLP does not warrant that any of the materials on its website are accurate, complete, or current.",data7:"7. Links Sullivan & Cromwell LLP has not reviewed all of the sites linked to its website and is not responsible for the contents of any such linked site.",data8:"8. Site Terms of Use Modifications Sullivan & Cromwell LLP may revise these Terms of Use for its website at any time without notice.",data9:"9. Governing Law Any claim relating to the Sullivan & Cromwell LLP website shall be governed by the applicable local laws without regard to conflict of law provisions.",data10:{title:"10. Privacy Policy Your privacy is critical to us. The following outlines our privacy policy:",sub1:"Before or at the time of collecting personal information, we will identify the purposes for which the information is being collected.",sub2:"We will gather and utilize personal data solely for fulfilling those purposes specified by us and for other compatible purposes unless we obtain the consent of the individual concerned or as required by law.",sub3:"We will only retain personal data as long as necessary for the fulfillment of those purposes.",sub4:"Personal information should be relevant to the purposes for which it is to be used, and to the extent necessary for those purposes, should be accurate, complete, and up-to-date.",sub5:"We will promptly provide clients with access to our policies and procedures for the administration of personal data.",sub6:"We are committed to conducting our practice in accordance with these principles to ensure that the confidentiality of client information is protected and maintained."}},terms:{title:"Terms of Service",backHome:"Back to Home",data1:"Welcome to Sullivan & Cromwell LLP. By continuing to browse and use this website, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions of use, which together with our privacy policy govern Sullivan & Cromwell LLP's relationship with you in relation to this website.",data2:'The term "Sullivan & Cromwell LLP" or "us" or "we" refers to the owner of the website. The term "you" refers to the user or viewer of our website.',data3:"The content of the pages of this website is for general information about our anti-fraud legal services only. It is subject to change without notice and does not constitute legal advice for any specific case.",data4:"Neither we nor any third parties provide any warranty as to the accuracy, timeliness, completeness or suitability of the information found on this website for any particular purpose.",data5:"Your use of any information on this website is entirely at your own risk. Any engagement of legal services requires a signed retainer agreement.",data6:"This website contains material which is owned by or licensed to us, including design, layout, look, appearance and graphics. Reproduction is prohibited other than in accordance with the copyright notice.",data7:"All trademarks reproduced on this website which are not the property of, or licensed to, the operator are acknowledged on the website.",data8:"Unauthorised use of this website may give rise to a claim for damages and/or be a criminal offence.",data9:"This website may contain links to other websites for reference. We do not endorse and have no responsibility for the content of the linked websites.",data10:"Your use of this website and any dispute arising out of such use is subject to applicable local law."},form:{title:"Confidential Case Intake",subtitle:"Share the basic details of your case. All information is treated as privileged and confidential.",name:"Full Name",namePlaceholder:"Enter your full name",email:"Email Address",emailPlaceholder:"Enter your email",areaCode:"Area Code",phone:"Phone Number",phonePlaceholder:"Enter your phone number",age:"Age",agePlaceholder:"Enter your age",gender:"Gender",genderPlaceholder:"Select gender",male:"Male",female:"Female",other:"Other",job:"Case Type",jobPlaceholder:"Select case type",submit:"Submit for Free Consultation",submitting:"Submitting...",required:"This field is required",invalidEmail:"Please enter a valid email",invalidPhone:"Please enter a valid phone number",invalidAge:"You must be 18 or above",invalidAgeCA:"You must be 18 or above"},success:{title:"Case Received",message:"Thank you. Our legal team will review your case and reach out within two business hours. Please keep an eye on your WhatsApp and email for the intake specialist's message.",backHome:"Back to Home",confirm:"Confirm",contact:"Contact Us"},faq:{title:"Frequently Asked Questions",des:"Get answers to common questions about anti-fraud legal services and fund recovery.",question1:"Why choose us for legal protection?",answer1:`We focus on anti-fraud legal services and have extensive experience and successful cases, offering the following advantages:

1. A professional team of anti-fraud lawyers who accurately analyze cases to improve recovery success rates.

2. Successfully recovered hundreds of millions in scam funds and served thousands of victims, with rich experience.

3. Efficient rights protection process, providing free case evaluations and quickly starting the fund recovery process.

4. Transparent fees with no hidden costs; some cases support a 'no win, no fee' model.

5. 24/7 legal support to ensure timely help for clients in recovering their losses.`,question2:"I got scammed in a financial investment, what should I do?",answer2:`Fraudulent investment scams are common in fake financial platforms, shady trading sites, and pyramid schemes. Here are some suggested steps:

1. Immediately stop all financial transactions to prevent further losses.

2. Keep all evidence, including transaction records, platform promotional materials, and chat logs with customer service.

3. Report to the police—visit the local public security bureau's economic investigation department, register your case, and submit all evidence. The police will investigate the traceability of the case.

4. Use legal methods to protect your rights. You can hire a professional lawyer to pressure the involved platform or third-party payment institutions, asking them to freeze funds or recover your investment.

5. Stay alert to avoid getting scammed again. Many scammers pretend to be 'rights protection companies' and ask for a 'service fee upfront' to help recover funds. This is usually a secondary scam!`,question4:"If you got scammed doing part-time order brushing, can you still get your money back?",answer4:`It's pretty tough to recover money from part-time order scams, but it's still possible. Here's what you can do:

1. Report it immediately: File a report with your local police as soon as possible and provide all related evidence, like chat records, payment receipts, and the scammer’s account info.

2. Connect with other victims: Join chat groups of other people who’ve been scammed to gather more clues and increase the chances of your case being taken up.

3. Seek legal help: Lawyers can help you give the police a more detailed analysis of your case and can use legal methods (like suing the scammer) to try to get your money back.

4. Stay alert to avoid being scammed again: Some scam groups might pose as 'victim protection organizations' and ask for extra fees—be careful!`,question5:"What's the success rate of getting the money back?",answer5:`The success rate depends on factors like the type of case and the flow of funds, but our professional team will do our best to increase the chances of recovery. Generally speaking:

Credit card fraud cases: success rate can be over 80%

Online scam cases: higher chances of recovery if the money hasn’t been moved

Illegal fundraising or P2P investment scams: harder to recover, but legal means can still improve the odds`,question6:"When is a good time to reach out to us? Is earlier better?",answer6:`The earlier you take action, the easier it is to recover the money. The best times to handle it are as follows:

1. Within 1–72 hours after being scammed: The funds haven’t fully moved yet, making this the stage with the highest chance of recovery.

2. Within 1–30 days after being scammed: You can still apply for freezing the funds, request platform investigations, etc.

3. Over 30 days: You can continue pursuing through blockchain tracking, international cooperation, and so on.

Don’t wait! The longer you drag it out, the more likely the money will be scattered through money-laundering chains.`},questionnaire:{q1:"Are you a resident of {{country}}?",q2:"Have you already filed a police report?",q3:"What is your current status regarding the loss?",q4:"What was the approximate amount involved?",q5:"What type of fraud are you dealing with?",q6:"What city are you located in?",yes:"Yes",no:"No",nc:"Not yet",noExperience:"No, this is my first time",next:"Next",submit:"Submit",submitting:"Submitting...",selectIdType:"Select fraud type",enterCity:"Enter your city",workTypes:{businessManager:"Under $10,000",professionalRole:"$10,000 - $50,000",serviceWorker:"$50,000 - $100,000",governmentEmployee:"$100,000 - $500,000",freelancer:"Over $500,000",student:"Prefer not to say",jobSeeking:"Still assessing",retired:"Multiple incidents",other:"Other"},education:{juniorHigh:"Within 24 hours",highSchool:"Within a week",associate:"Within a month",bachelor:"1 - 3 months ago",master:"3 - 6 months ago",phd:"Over 6 months ago"},idTypes:{id1:"Crypto Investment Scam",id2:"Online Investment Platform",id3:"Romance / Pig-Butchering",id4:"Bank Transfer / Telecom Fraud"}}},iM={nav:{home:"首頁",about:"關於我們",jobs:"詐騙類型",advantages:"為什麼選擇我們",faq:"常見問題",howToStart:"我們的流程",testimonials:"案件結果",applyNow:"免費諮詢"},hero:{badge:"反欺詐律師事務所 · 跨境追回",title:"追回網絡詐騙損失的資金",titleLine1:"網上被騙？",titleLine2:"我們幫你追回。",subtitle:"我們結合法律行動、資金流向分析和多司法管轄區合作，幫助網絡詐騙受害者追踪、凍結並追回被盜資產。",cta:"獲取免費諮詢",ctaSecondary:"常見案件類型",partTime:"快速響應",partTimeDesc:"首72小時是資金追踪和追回的黃金時間。",fullTime:"全程處理",fullTimeDesc:"從初步案件審核到法律行動和持續協調。",decor:{flexible:"保密處理",location:"跨境協調",savings:"結果導向策略",earnings:"持牌法律團隊"},features:{response:{title:"72小時響應",desc:"資金追踪和凍結的黃金窗口"},tracing:{title:"資金流向追踪",desc:"鏈上和鏈下交易分析"},legal:{title:"持牌法律團隊",desc:"具有真實法庭經驗的反欺詐律師"},network:{title:"跨境網絡",desc:"跨司法管轄區的銀行和法律合作夥伴"},confidential:{title:"嚴格保密",desc:"每個案件細節的特權處理"}},stats:{cases:"4,000+ 案件",experience:"反欺詐經驗"}},about:{badge:"關於律師事務所",title:"這不僅是資金追回 — 而是幫助你重新掌控。",description:"我們是一家專注於追回網絡投資詐騙、電信詐騙、釣魚和加密貨幣相關欺詐損失的反欺詐律師事務所。通過資金流向分析、法律路徑設計和跨境合作，我們幫助受害者快速鎖定關鍵賬戶和責任方 — 追求超越單純報警的追回效果。",description2:"我們的團隊由持牌律師、金融調查員和跨境合作夥伴組成。每個案件都會得到保密評估，客戶會收到清晰的行動計劃、現實的期望，以及整個過程中的持續更新。",globalReach:"多地區協調",globalReachDesc:"我們通過遍布亞洲、歐洲和北美的法律合作夥伴網絡，追踪跨境流動的資金。",cta:"提交案件詳情",titleAlt:"不僅是追蹤資金 — 我們幫助你重新掌控。",descAlt:"在大多數欺詐案件中，時間是決定因素。一旦資金通過多層次或跨境轉移，個人幾乎永遠無法自己完成追回。我們結合資金流向分析、法律路徑設計和多地區合作，快速鎖定關鍵賬戶和責任方 — 給你超越報警的更多追回空間。",descAlt2:"我們的服務涵蓋虛擬資產詐騙、銀行轉賬欺詐和所有類型的網絡欺詐 — 包括階段性分析、持續跟進和協調法律行動。",fact1Label:"案件經驗",fact1Value:"分析超過4,000宗案件",fact1Desc:"在投資、電信和加密貨幣欺詐場景中擁有豐富經驗。",fact2Label:"協調網絡",fact2Value:"600+追踪資源",fact2Desc:"用於資金追踪的跨境銀行、交易所和法律合作夥伴。",fact3Label:"黃金窗口",fact3Value:"72小時快速響應",fact3Desc:"首72小時至關重要 — 我們在接案後立即動員。"},ctaConnect:{badge:"讓我們談談",title:"為{{country}}欺詐受害者提供保密法律支持",description:"我們處理來自{{country}}的受害者查詢，並與國際合作夥伴協調處理跨境案件。",cta:"請求免費案件評估"},jobs:{title:"我們處理的常見網絡詐騙類型",titleLine1:"常見",titleLine2:"網絡詐騙類型",titleLine3:"我們幫你應對。",cta:"查看所有詐騙類型",subtitle:"了解常見策略有助於你評估情況並採取正確的下一步。下面的每個場景都概述了我們團隊如何處理追回。",applyNow:"討論我的案件",viewMore:"查看更多詐騙類型",perHour:"複雜程度",perDay:"處理案件",perMonth:"/月",positions:{dataAnnotation:{title:"加密貨幣詐騙",description:"假交易所、地毯式退出和錢包掏空計劃。我們追踪鏈上交易，識別出口，並與交易所和執法部門協調凍結資金。",tag1:"高風險",tag2:"鏈上追踪",tag3:"跨境"},dataCollection:{title:"網絡投資詐騙",description:"帶有操縱儀表板和阻止提款的假交易平台。我們調查平台，繪製資金路徑，並建立法律案件進行追回。",tag1:"平台調查",tag2:"資金路徑分析",tag3:"證據包"},survey:{title:"銀行轉賬詐騙",description:"冒充和授權推送支付欺詐，誘騙受害者將資金匯入欺詐者控制的賬戶。我們與銀行協調，盡快追踪和凍結賬戶。",tag1:"銀行協調",tag2:"賬戶追踪",tag3:"緊急響應"},dataEntry:{title:"浪漫及約會詐騙",description:"通過約會應用和社交媒體進行的長期社交工程，最終導致假投資或緊急匯款請求。我們繪製底層網絡，並在多個司法管轄區追蹤資金。",tag1:"社交工程",tag2:"網絡繪圖",tag3:"資金追回"},content:{title:"信用卡欺詐",description:"未經授權的收費、無卡欺詐和被盜卡信息在商戶間使用。我們支持退貨策略、證據收集以及對運營商的法律行動。",tag1:"退貨支持",tag2:"證據收集",tag3:"發卡行協調"},onlineCustomer:{title:"兼職及招聘詐騙",description:"要求「押金」、「培訓費」或基於任務的「解鎖」的假兼職工作和招聘報價。我們分析運營商，收集跨用戶證據，並追求法律追回路徑。",tag1:"集體案件",tag2:"運營商追踪",tag3:"集體協調",type:"常見"},other:{title:"其他網絡欺詐",description:"從賭博網站扣款到NFT掏空者 — 如果資金通過數字渠道轉移，我們可以評估追回是否可行。",tag1:"案件評估",tag2:"自定義策略",tag3:"可行性報告",type:"已評估"}},review1:'"幾週內追回了很大一部分 — 團隊日夜跟進案件。"',review2:'"他們找到了警方無法訪問的路徑，並直接與交易所協調。"',review3:'"從第一天開始就有清晰的期望 — 沒有虛假承諾，只有真正的計劃。"',review4:'"銀行協調很快。兩個收款賬戶及時被凍結。"',review5:'"我終於明白了我的錢發生了什麼，以及還有什麼可以做的。"',review6:'"專業、謹慎，真正專注於結果而不是費用。"'},advantages:{badge:"為什麼選擇我們",title:"一個為真正追回而建立的法律團隊，而不僅僅是諮詢。",titleLine1:"為",titleLine2:"真正追回",titleLine3:"而建立，而不僅僅是諮詢。",learnMore:"了解更多",subtitle:"欺詐追回需要速度、證據和跨境協調 — 這三件事個人很少能獨自獲得。",items:{flexibility:{title:"主動干預",description:"我們不僅等待報警 — 我們在接案後幾小時內開始資金追踪和法律行動。"},support:{title:"結果導向策略",description:"每個案件都會獲得帶有明確里程碑的現實追回計劃，而不是開放式的法律費用。"},earnings:{title:"跨境合作",description:"覆蓋多個司法管轄區的銀行、交易所和法律合作夥伴網絡。"},guidance:{title:"保密案件處理",description:"所有通信都受到保護。只有分配給你案件的團隊才能看到詳情。"}}},howToStart:{badge:"我們的流程",title:"追回資金只需4個關鍵步驟",subtitle:"結構化、透明的流程，讓你確切知道案件每個階段會發生什麼。",steps:{step1:{title:"初步諮詢",description:"收集案件背景和資金轉賬詳情，以評估情況和可能的方向。"},step2:{title:"資金路徑分析",description:"重建跨賬戶、平台和司法管轄區的資金流動，以識別關鍵節點。"},step3:{title:"證據與策略",description:"打包證據並設計針對你案件類型的法律回應。"},step4:{title:"持續法律支持",description:"通過協調的銀行、法律和跨境行動推動案件，直至解決。"}},cta:"開始免費諮詢"},team:{badge:"Our Legal Team",title:"Our Legal Team",subtitle:"Your case is assigned to the person who has handled that type before. Here's who you may be working with.",members:{member1:{title:"Nicole Friedlander",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-859-787-4156",description:"People come to us after they have already been told nothing can be done. In about half those cases, something can."},member2:{title:"John J. Liolos",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-603-365-1278",description:"Most of my files touch three or four jurisdictions at once. The hard part is figuring out which country process will actually get you somewhere."},member3:{title:"Steven R. Peikin",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-440-258-6622",description:"Speed matters. The first 48 hours after a transfer often decide whether the money can be frozen or gone."},member4:{title:"Melike Tokatlioglu",titleEn:"Partner \xb7 New York \xb7 +1-270-392-5015",description:"With digital assets, it comes down to three questions: where the money went, who controls that wallet, and what a court will accept as proof."}}},testimonials:{badge:"案件結果",title:"用戶反饋",subtitle:"來自我們處理過的案件的精選結果。客戶姓名已匿名以保護隱私。",cta:"獲取免費諮詢",review1:'"在陷入釣魚詐騙後，我聯繫了律師事務所。資金追踪在48小時內開始，我們最終追回了很大一部分損失。"',review1Name:"Smith",review1Role:"主要資金已成功追回",review2:'"我在一個假加密貨幣交易平台上損失了錢。團隊繪製了鏈上流程，與交易所合作，並達成了我認為不可能的和解。"',review2Name:"Jones",review2Role:"大部分錢已成功追回",review3:'"電信欺詐掏空了我的兩個銀行賬戶。律師們迅速與銀行協調，其中一個收款賬戶及時被凍結。"',review3Name:"Kaylee",review3Role:"一些重要資金已被追回"},cta2:{badge:"聯繫律師事務所",title1:"保密法律支持",title2:"當每個小時都至關重要時",description:"提交你的案件詳情以進行免費、無義務的評估。所有信息都被視為特權和機密。",feature1:"免費初步案件評估",feature2:"2個工作日內回覆",feature3:"持牌反欺詐法律團隊",feature4:"跨境協調可用",whyChooseUs:"為什麼客戶選擇我們",antiFraudLegalSupport:"反欺詐法律支持",agreeContact:"我同意我們的團隊可以通過WhatsApp或電子郵件聯繫我，處理我的申請。",formBadge:"保密接案",formTitle:"請求案件評估",applyNow:"提交免費諮詢"},footer:{brand:"Sullivan & Cromwell LLP · 反欺詐律師事務所",tagline:"專注於追回網絡詐騙損失資金的反欺詐法律團隊。",description:"Sullivan & Cromwell LLP是一家反欺詐律師事務所，幫助網絡投資詐騙、電信欺詐和加密貨幣相關欺詐的受害者通過法律行動和跨境合作追回被盜資金。",antiFraudLawFirm:"反欺詐律師事務所","247CaseIntake":"24/7 案件接案",quickLinks:"快速鏈接",contact:"聯繫方式",email:"contact@Sullivan & Cromwell LLP.com",emailUs:"聯繫我們（電郵）",callUs:"致電我們",visitUs:"造訪我們",copyright:"版權所有 © 2026 Sullivan & Cromwell LLP。保留所有權利。",rights:"保留所有權利",backToTop:"回到頂部",privacy:"隱私政策",terms:"服務條款",currentCountry:"{{country}}"},privacy:{title:"隱私政策",sub:"網站使用條款和條件",backHome:"回到首頁",data1:"1. 隱私政策藍圖 在收集個人信息之前或之時，我們將確定收集信息的目的。我們將僅為我們指定的目的以及其他兼容目的收集和使用個人數據，除非我們獲得相關個人的同意或法律要求。我們將僅保留個人數據，只要有必要實現這些目的。我們將通過合法和公平的方式收集個人信息，並在適當的情況下，在相關個人的知情或同意下收集。我們將通過安全保障措施保護個人數據，防止丟失或被盜，以及未經授權的訪問、披露、複製、使用或修改。個人信息應與其使用目的相關，並且在這些目的所必需的範圍內，應準確、完整和最新。",data2:"2. 條款 通過訪問本網站，你同意受本網站使用條款和條件、適用法律和法規的約束，並遵守它們。如果你不同意這些條款和條件中的任何一項，則禁止你使用或訪問本網站。本網站包含的材料受相關版權和商標法保護。",data3:{title:"3. 使用許可證 授予臨時下載Sullivan & Cromwell LLP網站上的材料（信息或軟件）一份的許可，僅供個人、非商業使用。這是許可證授予，而不是所有權轉讓，並且在本許可證下，你不得：",sub1:"修改或複製材料；",sub2:"將材料用於任何商業目的或任何公開展示（商業或非商業）；",sub3:"試圖對Sullivan & Cromwell LLP網站上包含的任何軟件進行解編譯或逆向工程；",sub4:"從材料中刪除任何版權或其他所有權符號；",sub5:"將材料轉讓給另一個人或「鏡像」材料到任何其他服務器。如果你違反這些限制中的任何一項，本許可證將自動終止，並且Sullivan & Cromwell LLP可隨時終止本許可證。"},data4:"4. 免責聲明 Sullivan & Cromwell LLP網站上的材料按「原樣」提供。Sullivan & Cromwell LLP不作任何明示或暗示的擔保，並在此否認和否定所有其他擔保，包括但不限於對適銷性、特定用途適用性或不侵犯知識產權或其他權利的暗示擔保或條件。本網站上的任何內容都不構成法律建議；結果因案件和司法管轄區而異。",data5:"5. 限制 在任何情況下，Sullivan & Cromwell LLP或其供應商均不對因使用或無法使用Sullivan & Cromwell LLP網站上的材料而引起的任何損害（包括但不限於數據或利潤丟失或業務中斷的損害）承擔責任。",data6:"6. 修訂和勘誤 出現在Sullivan & Cromwell LLP網站上的材料可能包含技術、排版或攝影錯誤。Sullivan & Cromwell LLP不保證其網站上的任何材料都是準確、完整或最新的。",data7:"7. 鏈接 Sullivan & Cromwell LLP尚未審查鏈接到其網站的所有網站，並且不對任何此類鏈接網站的內容負責。",data8:"8. 網站使用條款修訂 Sullivan & Cromwell LLP可隨時修訂其網站的這些使用條款，恕不另行通知。",data9:"9. 適用法律 與Sullivan & Cromwell LLP網站有關的任何索賠應受適用的當地法律管轄，而不考慮法律衝突規定。",data10:{title:"10. 隱私政策 你的隱私對我們至關重要。以下概述了我們的隱私政策：",sub1:"在收集個人信息之前或之時，我們將確定收集信息的目的。",sub2:"我們將僅為我們指定的目的以及其他兼容目的收集和使用個人數據，除非我們獲得相關個人的同意或法律要求。",sub3:"我們將僅保留個人數據，只要有必要實現這些目的。",sub4:"個人信息應與其使用目的相關，並且在這些目的所必需的範圍內，應準確、完整和最新。",sub5:"我們將及時向客戶提供我們的個人數據管理政策和程序的訪問權限。",sub6:"我們致力於按照這些原則開展業務，以確保客戶信息的機密性得到保護和維護。"}},terms:{title:"服務條款",backHome:"回到首頁",data1:"歡迎來到Sullivan & Cromwell LLP。繼續瀏覽和使用本網站，即表示你同意遵守並受以下使用條款和條件的約束，這些條款與我們的隱私政策一起規範Sullivan & Cromwell LLP與你在本網站方面的關係。",data2:"術語「Sullivan & Cromwell LLP」或「我們」或「我們的」指網站的所有者。術語「你」指本網站的用戶或觀看者。",data3:"本網站頁面的內容僅供一般了解我們的反欺詐法律服務。它如有更改，恕不另行通知，並不構成針對任何特定案件的法律建議。",data4:"我們和任何第三方均不保證在本網站上找到的信息對於任何特定目的的準確性、及時性、完整性或適用性。",data5:"你使用本網站上的任何信息完全由你自己承擔風險。任何法律服務的聘用都需要簽署聘請協議。",data6:"本網站包含我們擁有或許可的材料，包括設計、佈局、外觀、外觀和圖形。除非符合版權通知，否則禁止複製。",data7:"本網站上複製的所有非我們擁有或未許可給運營商的商標均在本網站上得到確認。",data8:"未經授權使用本網站可能會引起損害賠償索賠和/或構成刑事犯罪。",data9:"本網站可能包含指向其他網站的鏈接以供參考。我們不認可也不對鏈接網站的內容負責。",data10:"你對本網站的使用以及由此產生的任何爭議均受適用的當地法律管轄。"},form:{title:"保密案件接案",subtitle:"分享你案件的基本詳情。所有信息都被視為特權和機密。",name:"全名",namePlaceholder:"輸入你的全名",email:"電子郵件地址",emailPlaceholder:"輸入你的電子郵件",areaCode:"區號",phone:"電話號碼",phonePlaceholder:"輸入你的電話號碼",age:"年齡",agePlaceholder:"輸入你的年齡",gender:"性別",genderPlaceholder:"選擇性別",male:"男",female:"女",other:"其他",job:"案件類型",jobPlaceholder:"選擇案件類型",submit:"提交免費諮詢",submitting:"提交中...",required:"此為必填項",invalidEmail:"請輸入有效的電子郵件",invalidPhone:"請輸入有效的電話號碼",invalidAge:"你必須年滿18歲",invalidAgeCA:"你必須年滿18歲"},success:{title:"案件已接收",message:"謝謝。我們的法律團隊將審核你的案件，並在兩個工作日內聯繫你。請留意你的WhatsApp和電子郵件，以獲取接案專家的消息。",backHome:"回到首頁",confirm:"確認",contact:"聯繫我們"},faq:{title:"常見問題",des:"獲取有關反欺詐法律服務和資金追回的常見問題的答案。",question1:"為什麼選擇我們進行法律保護？",answer1:`我們專注於反欺詐法律服務，擁有豐富的經驗和成功案例，提供以下優勢：

1. 一支專業的反欺詐律師團隊，準確分析案件以提高追回成功率。

2. 成功追回數億欺詐資金，為數千名受害者提供服務，經驗豐富。

3. 高效的維權流程，提供免費案件評估並快速啟動資金追回流程。

4. 透明的費用，沒有隱藏成本；某些案件支持「不勝訴，不收費」模式。

5. 24/7法律支持，確保客戶及時獲得幫助以追回損失。`,question2:"我在金融投資中被騙了，該怎麼辦？",answer2:`欺詐性投資騙局在假金融平台、可疑交易網站和金字塔計劃中很常見。以下是一些建議步驟：

1. 立即停止所有金融交易，以防止進一步損失。

2. 保留所有證據，包括交易記錄、平台宣傳材料和與客服的聊天記錄。

3. 向警方報案 — 訪問當地公安局的經濟調查部門，登記你的案件，並提交所有證據。警方將調查案件的可追溯性。

4. 使用法律方法保護你的權利。你可以聘請專業律師向相關平台或第三方支付機構施壓，要求他們凍結資金或追回你的投資。

5. 保持警惕，避免再次被騙。許多騙子冒充「維權公司」，要求預付「服務費」以幫助追回資金。這通常是二次欺詐！`,question4:"如果你在兼職刷單中被騙，還能把錢拿回來嗎？",answer4:`從兼職刷單騙局中追回錢很困難，但仍然有可能。以下是你可以做的：

1. 立即報案：盡快向當地警方報案，並提供所有相關證據，如聊天記錄、付款收據和騙子的賬戶信息。

2. 聯繫其他受害者：加入其他被騙者的聊天群組，以收集更多線索並增加你案件被受理的機會。

3. 尋求法律幫助：律師可以幫助你向警方提供更詳細的案件分析，並可以使用法律方法（如起訴騙子）試圖拿回你的錢。

4. 保持警惕，避免再次被騙：一些欺詐團體可能冒充「受害者保護組織」並要求額外費用 — 小心！`,question5:"拿回錢的成功率是多少？",answer5:`成功率取決於案件類型和資金流動等因素，但我們的專業團隊將盡最大努力提高追回的機會。一般來說：

信用卡欺詐案件：成功率可超過80%

網絡欺詐案件：如果錢還沒有被轉移，追回的機會更高

非法集資或P2P投資欺詐：更難追回，但法律手段仍可提高幾率`,question6:"什麼時候聯繫我們比較好？越早越好嗎？",answer6:`你越早行動，就越容易追回錢。處理的最佳時間如下：

1. 被騙後1–72小時內：資金尚未完全轉移，這是追回機會最高的階段。

2. 被騙後1–30天內：你仍然可以申請凍結資金、請求平台調查等。

3. 超過30天：你可以繼續通過區塊鏈追踪、國際合作等方式追求。

不要等待！你拖得越久，錢就越有可能通過洗錢鏈分散開來。`},questionnaire:{q1:"你是{{country}}居民嗎？",q2:"你已經報警了嗎？",q3:"你目前關於損失的狀態是什麼？",q4:"涉及的金額大約是多少？",q5:"你正在處理什麼類型的欺詐？",q6:"你位於哪個城市？",yes:"是",no:"否",nc:"還沒有",noExperience:"沒有，這是我第一次",next:"下一頁",submit:"提交",submitting:"提交中...",selectIdType:"選擇欺詐類型",enterCity:"輸入你的城市",workTypes:{businessManager:"低於10,000美元",professionalRole:"10,000 - 50,000美元",serviceWorker:"50,000 - 100,000美元",governmentEmployee:"100,000 - 500,000美元",freelancer:"超過500,000美元",student:"不想說",jobSeeking:"仍在評估",retired:"多起事件",other:"其他"},education:{juniorHigh:"24小時內",highSchool:"一週內",associate:"一個月內",bachelor:"1 - 3個月前",master:"3 - 6個月前",phd:"超過6個月前"},idTypes:{id1:"加密貨幣投資欺詐",id2:"網絡投資平台",id3:"浪漫/殺豬盤",id4:"銀行轉賬/電信欺詐"}}},lM={en:{translation:aM},"zh-HK":{translation:iM}},cM="en";kt.use(PT).init({resources:lM,lng:cM,fallbackLng:"en",interpolation:{escapeValue:!1}});const uM=new qj,dM=()=>u.jsx(oM,{children:u.jsx(Qj,{client:uM,children:u.jsxs(NO,{children:[u.jsx(sM,{}),u.jsxs(bj,{children:[u.jsx(s_,{}),u.jsx(M_,{}),u.jsxs(QR,{basename:window.__APP_BASE__||"/",children:[u.jsx(nM,{}),u.jsxs(UR,{children:[u.jsx(Hs,{path:"/",element:u.jsx(tM,{children:u.jsx(qI,{})})}),u.jsx(Hs,{path:"/success",element:u.jsx(ZI,{})}),u.jsx(Hs,{path:"/privacy",element:u.jsx(YI,{})}),u.jsx(Hs,{path:"/terms",element:u.jsx(XI,{})}),u.jsx(Hs,{path:"*",element:u.jsx(QI,{})})]})]})]})]})})});Jx(document.getElementById("root")).render(u.jsx(dM,{}));
